f32_vacask_lin_points1: VACASK `from=1e3 to=2e3 mode="lin" points=1` runs two frequencies, 1k and 2k (points counts intervals; points=0 is 1k alone, points=2 is 1k, 1.5k, 2k)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=0.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis ac1 ac from=1e3 to=2e3 mode="lin" points=1
endc
